Package: omakasui-nvim
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nvim, git, gum, xdg-utils
Replaces: omakub-nvim (<< 1:0.0.2~), omadeb-nvim (<< 1:0.0.2~)
Breaks: omakub-nvim (<< 1:0.0.2~), omadeb-nvim (<< 1:0.0.2~)
Description: Pre-built LazyVim configuration (shared payload)
 Installs pre-cached LazyVim config and plugins to /usr/share/omakasui-nvim,
 plus the shared setup script. Install omakub-nvim or omadeb-nvim to get the
 project-specific setup command.

Package: omakub-nvim
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omakasui-nvim (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Pre-built LazyVim configuration for Omabuntu/Omakub
 Provides the omakub-setup-nvim command, which activates the shared
 omakasui-nvim payload for the current user.

Package: omadeb-nvim
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omakasui-nvim (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Pre-built LazyVim configuration for Omadeb
 Provides the omadeb-setup-nvim command, which activates the shared
 omakasui-nvim payload for the current user.
